# Pairs with NoKeyLost. The resize captures its shard set from the pinned
# shard count alone, ignoring a shard a completed split allocated above it
# (the #3880 shape), so that shard is neither copied, mirrored nor fenced and
# the resized copy lacks its keys.
MODULE: NoKeyLostResizeCapturesPinnedShardsOnly
TARGET: NoKeyLost
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the resize captures only the pinned shard, so a split-allocated shard is neither copied nor forwarded
PERTURBS: ResizeBegin

--- FIND
    /\ rzShards' = {s1, rmap}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the split-allocated shard is not captured.
    /\ rzShards' = {s1}
--- END
